<pre>	PMWATCH - March 31, 2002 -- Below is an interview conducted by journalist and author Amos Oz with 
	Ariel Sharon in 1982.  This is the image of the real Ariel Sharon, as anyone who knows anything 
        about Sharon is well aware, that faithfully reflects reality.  

	Indeed, as the interview illustrates beyond any doubt, this is a man willing to stop at nothing, 
	inluding sacrificing the blood of the innocent -- Palestinian or Israeli -- to further his grand 
	designs.  His comments explain perfectly what is taking place and can predict easily what is in store for 
	the region if no one stands up to stop this mad man.

	And yet, the portrait we get from CNN, MSNBC, and other US media outlets, even when the evidence is 
	flagrahtly clear that Mr. Sharon is intent on igniting a war if only he were given a chance, is that 
	of a tough warrior out simply to protect his people.

	And for those who may think this is harping on ancient history, please read <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/manager/features/display_message.asp">Sharon is Sharon is Sharon</a>, 
	published in Haaretz (April 13, 2001).

	Please impress the media to stop whitewashing a war criminal intent on driving the whole
	region into war.  

